        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Page Structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Home (`/`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Introduce [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/), highlight key features, and guide users to relevant sections."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Guest | Viewer | Member | Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (No login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View platform overview"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Browse featured content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Navigate to TV guide, live streams, or broadcaster pages"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Sign up or log in"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. TV Guide (`/guide`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Provide an interactive, scheduled program listing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Guest | Viewer | Member | Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (No login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View the schedule of upcoming programs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Search and filter by category, broadcaster, or show"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Click on shows to see details (descriptions, air times, producers)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Add shows to personal watchlist (requires login)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Live Stream (`/live`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Enable users to watch currently airing broadcasts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Guest | Viewer | Member | Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (No login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Watch live streams from broadcasters"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View real-time chat (login required to participate)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Share live streams via social media"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Show & Episode Pages (`/shows/:show_id` and `/episodes/:episode_id`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Display details about a specific show or episode."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Guest | Viewer | Member | Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (No login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View episode information (title, description, duration)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Watch VOD (if available)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Follow show for updates (login required)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Engage with comments or ratings (login required)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Broadcaster Pages (`/broadcasters/:broadcaster_id`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Provide a dedicated space for each broadcaster."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Guest | Viewer | Member | Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (No login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View broadcaster profile, mission, and featured content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Browse the broadcaster’s TV guide"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Follow the broadcaster (login required)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Contact the broadcaster (login required)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Creator & Producer Profiles (`/producers/:producer_id`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Highlight individual creators and their content."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Guest | Viewer | Member | Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (No login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View producer bio, featured content, and upcoming programs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Follow the producer (login required)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Contact the producer (login required)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. Content Submission & Media Management (`/submit`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Allow producers and broadcasters to upload and manage their video content."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (Login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Upload VODs or submit live programming"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Provide metadata (title, description, runtime, category)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Request a broadcast slot"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Manage submitted content (edit, delete, reschedule)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Attach closed captions & translations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Generate automatic captions (if enabled)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Set content visibility (public, private, members-only)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. Video Asset Library (`/media`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Enable producers and broadcasters to manage their media files."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (Login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View all uploaded video assets"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-78",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Search and filter by title, date, tags, or category"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-79",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Replace or update video files without losing metadata"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Assign videos to specific shows or episodes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Download or retrieve embed codes for external sharing"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "9. Bumper & Commercial Management (`/bumpers`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Manage bumpers, interstitials, and commercial spots."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Broadcaster | Admin (Login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Upload bumpers, station IDs, and promos"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-89",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Set rules for automatic bumper insertion"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-90",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Assign bumpers to specific shows or time slots"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-91",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Monitor bumper effectiveness (viewer retention data)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10. Advertising & Sponsorships (`/ads`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Manage ad campaigns and sponsorships."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Broadcaster | Admin (Login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-98",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Upload and schedule ad placements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-99",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Define ad targeting criteria (time slots, demographics)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-100",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Set ad campaign budgets and impressions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-101",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "View ad performance analytics"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "11. Closed Captions & Translations (`/captions`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Purpose**: Provide tools for adding and managing captions/subtitles."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Access**: Producer | Broadcaster | Admin (Login required)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-107",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Actions**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-108",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Upload closed captions in SRT, VTT, or TTML format"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-109",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Auto-generate captions using AI (if enabled)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-110",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Edit captions in a web-based caption editor"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-111",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Translate captions into multiple languages"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-112",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Set accessibility settings for default captions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
